+"""Run the production touch/Pencil state machine with deterministic host input.
+
+UIKit contact delivery and Wine output are small fakes; the gesture methods
+are extracted unchanged from ContentView.swift. This does not replace a real
+Pencil/device check. Set TMPDIR and CLANG_MODULE_CACHE_PATH before running.
+"""
